[en.FOCUS_C12_UPGRADE_CATAPULT]
Upgrade Catapult

[en.FOCUS_C12_UPGRADE_CATAPULT_desc]
Let’s shift our research focus toward developing even larger and more sophisticated catapults, so that even in harsh environments like mountainous terrain, our soldiers can accurately hurl cannonballs at the enemy’s skulls.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UPGRADE_CATAPULT]
升级投石器

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UPGRADE_CATAPULT_desc]
将我们的科研重心转向研究更加庞大和精巧的投石器，让我们的士兵即使在山地等恶劣环境也可以准确无误的把炮弹砸向敌军的脑壳

